("A auditoria mostrou que o modelo erra muito quando sugere casa, cidade, prédios ou outros. Essas # imagens tiveram o ambiente revisado: # estavam erradas, # delas eram floresta.","The audit showed the model often fails when it suggests house, city, buildings or other. Those # images had their setting reviewed: # were wrong, # of them were forest.","La auditoría mostró que el modelo falla mucho cuando sugiere casa, ciudad, edificios u otros. Esas # imágenes tuvieron el entorno revisado: # estaban mal, # de ellas eran bosque."),
